# The generated reference is authored with LF and regenerated byte-for-byte on
# every platform. Without this, Windows checkout would rewrite 9,000 files to
# CRLF and every regeneration would look like a whole-tree diff - which would
# destroy the one property the generator is built around: that a regeneration
# diff IS the client patch delta.
reference/api/** text eol=lf
data/*.json       text eol=lf
# The generator rewrites this file whole to refresh the table inside it, with LF,
# so it needs the same treatment as the reference tree even though the prose
# around the markers is hand-written.
skills/restrictions/SKILL.md text eol=lf
*.lua             text eol=lf
*.py              text eol=lf
